        "zh": "Seanime 是一款专为动漫和漫画爱好者设计的开源媒体服务器，解决了跨平台内容管理分散的常见问题。它通过整合 AniList 和 MyAnimeList 等多个数据源，提供统一的 Web 界面和桌面应用，实现无缝的媒体库管理。用户可本地部署以集中管理收藏、追踪观看进度，并集成种子或 Debrid 服务获取内容，为追求自主控制的爱好者提供了实用的自托管解决方案，替代商业流媒体平台。",
        "es": "Seanime is an open-source media server specifically designed for anime and manga enthusiasts, solving the common problem of fragmented content management across different platforms. Its technical strength lies in integrating multiple data sources like AniList and MyAnimeList with a unified web interface and desktop app, allowing seamless library organization. Users can deploy it locally to centralize their collection, track viewing progress, and even integrate with torrent or debrid services for content acquisition, making it a practical self-hosted alternative to commercial streaming services.",
